Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.87,0:00:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.01,0:01:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.37,0:01:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek's winged dragon, Ara, is not a\Nmonster you want to be messing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.17,0:01:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially when it's in its Phoenix mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.39,0:01:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yugi's got an Egyptian\Ngod card on the field, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.65,0:01:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that mean Yugi\Nand Marek are even now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.89,0:01:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even close, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek's Egyptian god card\Nis in a class by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.77,0:01:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I ought to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.23,0:01:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,When Marek attacked me with that monster,\NI was knocked out cold. Poor Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.89,0:01:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.85,0:01:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.01,0:01:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.25,0:01:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,my Sky Dragon's special ability shall\Nrid the field of your Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.83,0:01:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Slifer!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.47,0:01:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy Ra with your second mouth now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.17,0:01:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, Barrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.63,0:01:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.87,0:01:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Slyper's ability didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.57,0:02:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you honestly think you\Ncould destroy a creature
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.55,0:02:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,as powerful as my winged\Ndragon of Ra that easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.03,0:02:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but Ra is invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.27,0:02:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my divine creature will\Nunleash its fiery wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.33,0:02:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ra's Phoenix ability is about to activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.97,0:02:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,instantly incinerating\Neverything in its path.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.63,0:02:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yugi has Slifer on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean that Yugi's Egyptian god
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.07,0:02:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,card will disintegrate\Nat the hands of Marix?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.65,0:02:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall surrender 1,000 of my life\Npoints now, such a small price to pay,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.73,0:02:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,especially when it's my weaker\Nself that's paying the price,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,with his body, now Pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.87,0:02:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can activate the winged\Ndragon's most devastating ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.99,0:02:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,behold, the rage of Ra as it\Nrins the field of your sliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.63,0:03:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what happened to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.59,0:03:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Barrow, but your\NEgyptian God card is no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.51,0:03:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.33,0:03:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just the beginning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.47,0:03:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.63,0:03:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.99,0:03:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I plan to prolong your anguish\Nfor as long as I can until
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.39,0:03:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the Shadow Realm has claimed\Neverything that you now possess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, please tell me you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.51,0:03:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.23,0:03:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to concentrate\Non defeating Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.67,0:03:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,because if he wins, the\Nentire world will suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My winged dragon has completed its task,\Nso I shall return it to my graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right, Maric used his\NMonster Reborn to bring back Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.19,0:03:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I was only on\Nthe field for one turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.95,0:04:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, that means Yugi's safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.73,0:04:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure that creep has\Nsomething else planned for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.41,0:04:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a small taste of what lies ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.71,0:04:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but I assure you the worst is yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.09,0:04:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy your life points one by one\Nas the darkness slowly consumes your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.91,0:04:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Pharaoh, but I'm afraid you haven't\Nseen the last of my Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.61,0:04:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ra will return to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.19,0:04:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my face-down card,\Na trap called Zombie's Jewel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.57,0:04:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He can bring back Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.81,0:04:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This card allows me to\Ntake a certain magic
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.47,0:04:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,card from your graveyard\Nand place it in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.79,0:04:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have a feeling you know exactly\Nwhat card I'm taking, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.97,0:04:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the one card you possess\Nwith the power to bring back Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.11,0:04:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If you know, then tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.35,0:04:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you'll have to speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.85,0:05:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.83,0:05:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.33,0:05:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm permitted to reclaim control\Nof your monster reborn magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.57,0:05:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your precious magic card will allow my
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.61,0:05:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,winged dragon of Ra to\Ncontinue its onslaught.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.03,0:05:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But since I just played my zombie's\Njewel trap, you may now draw one card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.59,0:05:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps this is the\Ncard that can save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.53,0:05:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The one Kaiba handed to\Nyou when our duel began.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.85,0:05:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, in the end, there's\Nnothing that can truly save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.87,0:05:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But perhaps you can delay your\Ndemise for a bit. So draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.23,0:05:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadows grow impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.41,0:05:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, so do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.09,0:05:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.65,0:05:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Yugi can win if he\Ndraws the card you gave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.01,0:05:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt it, but it should\Nbe interesting to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.61,0:05:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi doesn't even have one monster\Non the field to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.39,0:06:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If Merrick brings back his Egyptian god\Ncard, Yugi will be crushed. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.91,0:06:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,When Ra comes back, it'll\Nhave zero attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That means it can't do any damage\Nto Yugi's life points, right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.45,0:06:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.36,0:06:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we don't know enough about\NMarek's card to assume anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.01,0:06:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.11,0:06:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Ra's got a whole bag of\Ntricks we haven't even seen yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.69,0:06:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick wisely, for you know what\Nbecomes of those I defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.05,0:06:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Their souls are banished for eternity,\Nand their treasures become mine to keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it look familiar, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.23,0:06:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.35,0:06:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That belongs to Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have been sent\Nto the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.45,0:06:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we should have known\NMaric was behind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This item is my trophy for\Neliminating your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.57,0:06:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I win this game, I'll be adding\Nyour Millennium Puzzle to my collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.15,0:06:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.15,0:06:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever wondered what\Nyour defeat will be like?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.35,0:07:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll face the same downfall\Nas your friend Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.73,0:07:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll enter the shadow\Nscreaming just as he did and then
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.99,0:07:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you shall join the ranks of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.51,0:07:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,my other victims pharaoh no
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.25,0:07:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,one has been able to stop\Nthe destructive rampage of my
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.71,0:07:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,winged dragon of raw And when\Nit releases its rage upon you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.41,0:07:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be cast into the dark abyss\Nwhile I receive the ultimate prize,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.49,0:07:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,the boundless power of the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.37,0:07:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, draw your card so\Nthe suffering can continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.71,0:07:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.17,0:07:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to draw\Nthe card Kaiba gave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.93,0:07:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,According to Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.07,0:07:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,it could be our only hope of\Nstopping Merrick's Egyptian God card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.61,0:07:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.01,0:08:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba put his faith in us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.81,0:08:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we need to put our faith in him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.19,0:08:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.31,0:08:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh's faith in Kaiba has\Ninvoked the energies of ancient Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.21,0:08:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no doubt that he\Nhas drawn the card he needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.09,0:08:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've placed a card face-down, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.67,0:08:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn has ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.01,0:08:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi didn't even look at that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.39,0:08:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen Yugi do that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no idea what he just played.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.11,0:08:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he thinking, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.99,0:08:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Seto, what card do\Nyou think he just drew?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.55,0:08:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.49,0:08:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Yugi could know\Nwhat card he just put on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.11,0:08:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Deny your destiny no longer, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.15,0:08:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fiend sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.49,0:08:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate has allowed the Pharaoh to\Ndraw the card you gave to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.45,0:09:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I've placed my chosen card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.37,0:09:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn is now over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.03,0:09:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that the impending threat of the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.83,0:09:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow Realm has clouded\Nyour thought process.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.83,0:09:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.65,0:09:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why else would you place a card on the\Nfield without looking at it first, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.05,0:09:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek, you wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.03,0:09:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, back to the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.43,0:09:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for my Egyptian\NGod card to return to the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,field in all of its fiery\Nglory to wipe them out forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.19,0:09:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Monster Reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.21,0:09:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Winged Dragon of Ra, return to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise, my beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand beside me, and together we'll win!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.17,0:10:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall now activate my Egyptian\NGod card's most devastating ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.63,0:10:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,making Ra completely indestructible\Nand sealing your fate, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.03,0:10:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself, Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.07,0:10:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.65,0:10:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm transforming my life points\Ninto Ra's attack points. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.55,0:10:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster's absorbing my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.29,0:10:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, a small amount of\Nmy power will remain with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.59,0:10:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm not gone completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.53,0:10:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And you think it's wise to\Nweaken yourself like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.07,0:10:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're risking your fate on one move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.45,0:10:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick almost completely\Ndisappeared. That's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.33,0:10:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if Yugi survives this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.99,0:10:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all that's left of me, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.95,0:10:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest has fused together with Rob.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.41,0:11:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I have become one with\Nmy Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.13,0:11:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the same tactic I used\Nto destroy your friend Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I've created a beast that\Ncan wipe you out with one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.15,0:11:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,blast by transferring all but\None of my life points to Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.49,0:11:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my Egyptian God card has\Nalmost 3,000 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.91,0:11:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.35,0:11:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Next I'll sacrifice my\NJura-Gado and transfer
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.97,0:11:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,its strength to my winged\Ndragon of Ra as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.87,0:11:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch its power grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.95,0:11:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ra now has 4,699 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.69,0:11:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,More than enough to destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one attack and this duel is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.51,0:11:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That monster is way too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.19,0:11:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If Merrick attacks Yugi's life points\Ndirectly, Merrick wins the shadow game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.69,0:11:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be something left he can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.27,0:12:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now winged Dragon of Ra, attack\Nhis life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.19,0:12:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over, Barrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to disappoint you. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.03,0:12:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I reveal my face down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.35,0:12:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiend Sanctuary!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.43,0:12:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the card I gave him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.89,0:12:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The one card that can\Nsave him from Ra's attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.93,0:12:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yugi placed it on the field\Nwithout even looking at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So how could he have known\Nthat he played the right card?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.31,0:12:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.77,0:12:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be some sort of a trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.29,0:12:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see if it works!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.85,0:12:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the magic of Fiend Sanctuary!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.67,0:12:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch and learn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.45,0:12:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.49,0:12:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card was given to me by\Na friend to help me take you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.15,0:12:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now meet the instrument\Nof your destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.95,0:13:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called a metal fiend token!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.85,0:13:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.51,0:13:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek's winged dragon of\NRa will attack that metal
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.07,0:13:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I will attack Yugi's life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.03,0:13:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your eye on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.27,0:13:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.25,0:13:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That token is casting a reflection of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.91,0:13:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's precisely what it's\Ndoing, Merrick. You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.85,0:13:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I am no longer the target\Nof your Egyptian god card's attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.25,0:13:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it shall attack you! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.35,0:13:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I remember correctly, you've given\Nall but one of your life points to Ra,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.07,0:13:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,which means you'll be wiped out by the\Nhands of your own creature, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.83,0:13:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ra won't destroy me, with only\None life point to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.39,0:13:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you don't have much\Nof a choice in the matter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.69,0:13:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You go, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.25,0:13:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We knew you'd have to smart that freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.03,0:13:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You the man, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.25,0:13:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go ahead and finish this guy off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.53,0:14:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I must stop my winged dragon of Ra\Nfrom attacking or I'll lose the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.61,0:14:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek, as soon as your attack hits\Nmy token, this duel's over! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.21,0:14:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, Barrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.53,0:14:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks to me like your\Nlittle magic card didn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.49,0:14:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You were a fool to believe\Nyou'd win this duel that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You were never in control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.49,0:14:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been toying with you the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.39,0:14:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:14:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.01,0:15:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.49,0:15:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek should have lost a duel\Nafter that attack just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.83,0:15:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you escape that blast?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.09,0:15:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I played a magic card just like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.17,0:15:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and it stopped Ra's attack before\Nit destroyed me. Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.75,0:15:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What magic card?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.43,0:15:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the D-Fusion magic card\NI took from your deck, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.17,0:15:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It separated me from my winged\Ndragon of Ra just before its attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.29,0:15:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That canceled out the\Nbattle before it began.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.49,0:15:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The saving my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.03,0:15:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So your strategy failed, and\Nnow I'm stronger than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.91,0:15:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That was quick thinking on Maric's part.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.61,0:15:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,By using the Diffusion Magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.03,0:15:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,he was able to end his own\Nattack before it backfired.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.51,0:15:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, just as I suspected,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.05,0:16:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi wasn't able to successfully use\Nthe card I gave him to defeat Maric.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.69,0:16:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up, my pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.71,0:16:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you will save mankind\Njust as the scriptures predict.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.97,0:16:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one more thing Yugi can\Ngain from the magic card I gave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.91,0:16:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if he's smart\Nenough to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.63,0:16:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I've regained\Nevery one of my life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.31,0:16:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,my weaker half regains his body\Nfrom the Shadow Realm. For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.55,0:16:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.61,0:16:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Ra, return to the graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.55,0:16:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll place my Monster\NReborn in the graveyard as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll put this\Nface down on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.57,0:16:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough damage for now. That creep,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.35,0:16:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,he's gonna bring back\Nhis Monster Reborn card
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.93,0:16:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,to summon Ra just like he\Ndid before Come on, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.49,0:17:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this guy. It's my move now. Your\Nmetal fiend may be protecting you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.75,0:17:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but it costs you 1,000 life points\Neach turn to keep it on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.61,0:17:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.75,0:17:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And as I lose life points, I also\Nlose a part of you to the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.37,0:17:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do whatever it takes\Nto defeat him. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.85,0:17:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.71,0:17:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to have to put\Nyou through this, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.97,0:17:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem. Just win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.51,0:17:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I give up 1,000 life points to\Nkeep Metal Fiend on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.01,0:17:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.27,0:17:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, it's Yugi who suffers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.25,0:17:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so you can keep a\Nuseless creature on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.89,0:17:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems like a desperate act to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.09,0:17:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps Yugi does know the second\Nfunction of my magic card after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.69,0:17:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll just have to wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.83,0:17:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.01,0:18:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew your card would save me\Nthe moment you handed it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether you believe it or not,\Nour spirits are connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.87,0:18:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let the duel continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.61,0:18:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I reveal my magic card!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.57,0:18:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Not multiply!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.13,0:18:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.05,0:18:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This card allows me to\Nincrease the number of
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.67,0:18:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,metal fiends I have on the\Nfield from one to three!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.77,0:18:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's going to sacrifice them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.85,0:18:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, looks like Yugi did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.67,0:18:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He figured out how to make\Nthe most of my magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.97,0:18:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the Pharaoh about to summon\Nhis second Egyptian god card?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.25,0:18:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrificed my three metal fiend tokens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.93,0:18:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,To play this, Obelisk the Tormentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.97,0:18:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, the Egyptian god\Ncard I won from Kaiba
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.43,0:19:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Summoned with the help\Nof two of my friends
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.51,0:19:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Stare into the face of defeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.01,0:19:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick This is awesome\NThe obelisk will crush
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.79,0:19:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, I knew Yugi\Nwould turn things around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.81,0:19:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get a load of Merrick, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.73,0:19:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so scared his hair is standing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.85,0:19:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, he always looks like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.19,0:19:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I let him do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.55,0:19:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, my Egyptian god monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.77,0:19:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Merrick's life points now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.11,0:19:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not be destroyed!
